   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 7.2,
    "text": "Some people are able to move on and sort of launch back into life and and other people"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 7.2,
    "end": 15.2,
    "text": "struggle more and and can be incredibly overwhelmed and I think the key is wherever you are on that"
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 15.2,
    "end": 22.64,
    "text": "spectrum is to seek the support that you need because as you said the more we sit in anxiety"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 22.64,
    "end": 28.32,
    "text": "and depression on that fight or flight mode like oh my gosh when is the other shoe gonna drop when"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 28.32,
    "end": 33.84,
    "text": "is this going to come back? Is this going to come back? What do I do? How do I move on?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 33.84,
    "end": 41.36,
    "text": "That impacts our body in so many ways, including importantly our immune systems and our ability"
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 41.36,
    "end": 48.72,
    "text": "to not only fight infections, but also to surveil against cancer cells. And so gosh,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 49.28,
    "end": 56.24,
    "text": "having a doing whatever you can to really support your body to be as healthy as possible is really"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 56.24,
    "end": 61.28,
    "text": "critical at this time. And so thinking about it, and you mentioned right there, sort of the"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 61.28,
    "end": 66.4,
    "text": "practical steps in the mental health and psychological health sort of components,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 66.4,
    "end": 73.92,
    "text": "I see those as so intertwined. And so again, wherever you are on this spectrum of needs,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 73.92,
    "end": 79.6,
    "text": "identifying people to help in providing the support that you do need. And I would encourage,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 79.6,
    "end": 87.92,
    "text": "right anybody who is feeling overwhelmed and is sitting in a lot of fear or sadness to find someone"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 87.92,
    "end": 94.88,
    "text": "to process some of those feelings with because that will be a key first step to actually being"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 94.88,
    "end": 97.88,
    "text": "able to manage some of the more practical pieces."
   }
  ]
 },
